                                "sense_id": "906233c5-2b45-37e5-a810-cf1542f8e9f0",
                                "text": "Till deep misery, if nothing softer will, have driven you out of your Speciosites into your Sincerities; and you find there either is a Godlike in the world, or else ye are an unintelligible madness;"
